{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32918","headline":"送圆鉴上人游天台 · 李郢","name":"送圆鉴上人游天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岭草堂留不住，独携瓶锡向天台。\n霜清海寺闻潮至，日宴江船乞食回。\n华顶夜寒孤月落，石桥秋尽一僧来。\n灵溪道者相逢处，阴洞泠泠竹室开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}